{%- capture avada_seo_meta_description -%}Shop {{ collection.title }} at Petaloons — India's #1 pet fashion brand. {{ collection.products_count }}+ designs, handcrafted in India. Free shipping ₹999+, easy returns, pan-India delivery. Order today.{%- endcapture -%}
